Let $v = v_{n-1}$ and $G=K_{n-1} \setminus \{v\}$ the resulting
clique on $[n-2]$. Then with $T_{n-2}$ being a star centered at
$y$, the resulting $Z_{n-2}^1$ does not have $y$ in its vertex
set. Choosing any $u \neq y$ as $u=v_{n-2}$ as the pivot vertex in
$\FILL(Z_{n-2}^1)$ will result in a cycle

