%that there are infinitely many $d$'s such that $K_{d+4}^d$ has a Hamiltonian $d$-hypertree over %$\Q$, unless a well known and widely believed (and also implied by the Riemann hypothesis)
% conjecture of Artin about the primitive roots is false.
